This directory is NOT covered by the MIT license in the repository root.

It is a modified copy of the `mipi_rgb` component from ESPHome 2026.7.4
(https://github.com/esphome/esphome), Copyright (c) 2019 ESPHome, and it keeps
ESPHome's split licensing:

  mipi_rgb.cpp, mipi_rgb.h        GPL-3.0-or-later
  *.py                            MIT

The full upstream license text is in ../../LICENSES/ESPHome-LICENSE.txt.

Modifications vs upstream (all default to upstream behaviour):

  1. The hardcoded `bounce_buffer_size_px = width * 10` is replaced by a
     configurable `bounce_buffer_lines` YAML option (default 10).
  2. The unconditional per-loop `esp_lcd_rgb_panel_restart()` call can be
     disabled with the `force_restart` YAML option (default true).
  3. Optional instrumentation: `on_vsync` / `on_frame_buf_complete` counters
     plus VSYNC interrupt-latency and end-of-frame slack measurement, enabled
     by the `desync_report_interval` YAML option (default 0s = disabled) and
     tuned by `late_frame_threshold`.

Everything else is unchanged.
